   "post_caption": "Initial thoughts on what just happened to American politics and why it’s pretty terrifying. It’s no secret that, despite my far left political ideology and membership in the Democratic Socialists of America, I am a closet Trump fan/follower..but even I am a bit worried about just how precarious things are without any ability or political desire to check the executive power he will hold",
