   "owner_name": "Dan Frank",
   "platform": "facebook",
   "post_caption": "To kick off Election Day, I’ll be doing my best to battle political apathy with some reminders that ‘politics’ - rather than being a tedious slog of dread and misery - is actually simultaneously an unimaginably important exercise of civic engagement (vital to the health of a democracy) AND the most entertaining surreal form of entertainment available. \n\nYou can (correctly) call it corrupt, unfair, inefficient, wasteful, violent, crazy or anti-egalitarian bourgeois trickery all you’d like…. but, don’t ever call politics boring or stupid.",
