   "post_caption": "A collection of excerpts from Michael Wolff's 'Siege' (2018) and 'Landslide' (2020) about Donald Trump's inexplicable streak of luck, a phenomenon so extraordinary that those around him began see as a supernatural force or divine intervention. These quotes were published before: 2 impeachments; a near fatal case of COVID, losing the 2020 election, inciting an insurrection to overturn the election, 91 felony indictments (34 of which he was convicted for already) and an attempted assassination which came within 2 inches of a pure headshot.\n\nNOTE: these books are as far from pro-Trump as one could imagine. In fact, the first book in the series 'Fire and Fury' was the catalyst for Steve Bannon's termination from the White House",
